      <blockquote class="text-[16px] sm:text-[19px] text-[#243D5D] leading-relaxed font-normal mb-6 max-w-[840px] mx-auto">
        "I’ve been teaching tax lien and tax deed investing for more than 30 years, and I tell every student: it is simple, but it is not easy. This is not a quick hit or 'buy today, make money tomorrow.' Tax-defaulted property is not going anywhere, and this business rewards people who learn the process and keep improving over time. But handing someone software and leaving them alone is useless. That's why I brought in Tax Sale Resources as our trusted research partner and built the Magic Map™ System, pairing nationwide data with training classes and AI-assisted research training. We show you step-by-step how to upload county lists, ask the right questions, check market values, and narrow 2,000 properties down to the few worth bidding on."
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Stars -->
